---
import BlogPostLayout from '@layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { getPost } from '@lib/blog';

const post = getPost('sectech-roadshow-2026');
---
<BlogPostLayout post={post}>
  <p class="lead">
    Ktronics is exhibiting at the SecTech Roadshow 2026 across five
    Australian cities this May. If you&apos;re reviewing CCTV, access
    control, or integrated security in the next 24 months, this is the
    right time to connect.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we&apos;re on the road</h2>

  <p>
    SecTech is the security industry&apos;s travelling expo : one
    floor, one day per city, every major manufacturer and integrator in
    the country at the same venue. It&apos;s also where we get half a
    year&apos;s worth of supplier conversations done in a week.
  </p>

  <p>
    For commercial operators, it&apos;s the easiest place to compare
    platforms side-by-side without sales-pitch overhead. We&apos;ll have
    our stand set up in each city and we&apos;re booking 30-minute
    walk-the-options meetings with anyone who&apos;s scoping a project
    in the next two years.
  </p>

  <h2>When we&apos;ll be in your city</h2>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>City</th>
        <th>Date</th>
        <th>Venue</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Brisbane</strong></td>
        <td>Tue 12 May 2026, 12pm – 6pm</td>
        <td>Royal International Convention Centre, Hall A</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Sydney</strong></td>
        <td>Thu 14 May 2026, 12pm – 6pm</td>
        <td>Rosehill Gardens Racecourse, JGC Hall Room C</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Melbourne</strong></td>
        <td>Tue 19 May 2026, 12pm – 6pm</td>
        <td>Melbourne Convention &amp; Exhibition Centre, Goldfields Theatre</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Adelaide</strong></td>
        <td>Thu 21 May 2026, 12pm – 6pm</td>
        <td>Adelaide Showgrounds, Ridley Centre Gate 2</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Perth</strong></td>
        <td>Tue 26 May 2026, 12pm – 6pm</td>
        <td>Crown Perth, Grand Ballroom</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>And: Australia&apos;s Fastest Technician</h2>

  <p>
    If you&apos;re an experienced or aspiring security technician, visit
    our stand in your nearest city for your chance to compete for the
    title of <strong>Australia&apos;s Fastest Technician</strong>. The
    Sydney 2024 record sits at <strong>2 minutes 10 seconds</strong>.
    Come and break it.
  </p>

  <div class="callout">
    <p>
      <strong>Want to lock in a 30-minute meeting at your local SecTech
      stop?</strong> <a href="/contact/?subject=SecTech%202026%20meeting">Get
      in touch</a> with the city you&apos;ll be at and we&apos;ll
      confirm a time on the day.
    </p>
  </div>
</BlogPostLayout>
